{"resourceIdentifier":"5286","resourceName":"Saytek Plastic Recycling Facility","description":"The Saytek Plastic Recycling Facility, established by Saytek Medikal ve Plastik San. Tic. A.S., includes a plastic bottle recycling line fed with plastic waste material sourced from licensed material recovery facilities. The Project activity has been implemented in Gumusova Organized Industrial Site of Duzce Province in Turkiye. The Project aims to recycle plastic waste while reducing energy consumption that would otherwise be required to produce plastic products made of virgin inputs, and consequently causing greenhouse gases emissions (GHGs). In other words, compared to traditional plastic production methods, projects reduce energy consumption. This efficiency translates into a direct reduction of greenhouse gas emissions, aiding in the fight against climate change. The facility started its’ operation on 04-April-2023 which is implemented from the first invoice generated on the sales of recycled plastic flakes. The start date of the project is the date on which the project began generating GHG emission reductions, i.e. the date on which the project began producing the recycled plastic flakes. The calculation of GHG emission reductions by the project activity is limited to carbon dioxide (CO2) only and its primary source is reducing energy consumption that would otherwise be required for the production of plastic products made of virgin inputs, and consequently reducing greenhouse gases emissions (GHGs). Total emission reductions estimated in this crediting period 04 April 2023 to 03 April 2030 is 116,011 tCO2e for 7 years and yearly estimation is 16,573 tCO2e/year.","location":{"latitude":40.837500,"longitude":30.952800},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-10-30","endExclusive":"2024-11-30","endInclusive":"2024-11-29"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5286"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Duzce"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"16573"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VMR0007"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VCS Validation/Verification Body"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"25/08/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 04/04/2023 - 03/04/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=119885&IDKEY=s0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla94165321415","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PD_DRAFT_5286_02OCT2024.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-10-03T16:07:38.877Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=121480&IDKEY=fiofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq34167520920","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PD_PCP_5286_02OCT2024.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-10-30T18:15:44.82Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=119560&IDKEY=90e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9164873240","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Saytek Recycling Facility_Listing-Representation-Multiple-PPs_signed-.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-09-26T16:06:48.507Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID